## FLUTTER VERSION MANAGER

This project uses FVM (Flutter Version Manager).
Always use `fvm flutter` instead of `flutter` for all commands.
Always use `fvm dart` instead of `dart` for all Dart commands.
Flutter version: 3.35.7

Examples:
- `fvm flutter pub get`
- `fvm flutter pub run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs`
- `fvm flutter test`
- `fvm flutter build apk`
- `fvm dart format .`

---

## DEPENDENCY VERSIONS

Always use the latest stable version of each package that:
- Is compatible with Flutter 3.35.7
- Does not introduce breaking changes
- Has null-safety support
- Is not marked as discontinued or deprecated on pub.dev

Before suggesting a package version, verify compatibility with
Flutter 3.35.7 and Dart SDK constraints.
Never pin to an outdated version unless a newer one causes a known
breaking change — in that case, explain why.

