## BACKGROUNDS — WHITE / OFF-WHITE ONLY

The app background is **never dark**. All backgrounds are white or off-white:

| Surface | Colour | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| Primary background | `#FFFFFF` | Main screen background, cards, bubbles |
| Secondary background | `#F5F4F0` | Section backgrounds, input fields, inactive areas |
| Tertiary background | `#F0EFE8` | Subtle dividers, nested containers |

**Never use dark backgrounds** (`#000`, `#111`, `#1A1A1A`, `#2C2C2C`, or any dark grey)
as a page or section background. The only exception is hero banners (e.g. bid won green
hero, payment confirmed green hero) which use brand colours, not dark colours.

Dark mode is NOT supported. Do not implement dark mode. Do not use
`MediaQuery.platformBrightness` to switch backgrounds to dark.

---

## TYPOGRAPHY — DM SANS (GOOGLE FONTS)

This app uses **DM Sans** as the sole typeface via the `google_fonts` package.
Never use system fonts (SF Pro, Roboto) directly.

Setup in `core/theme/app_theme.dart`:
```dart
import 'package:google_fonts/google_fonts.dart';

ThemeData buildAppTheme() {
  final base = ThemeData(
    colorScheme: ColorScheme.fromSeed(seedColor: const Color(0xFF378ADD)),
    useMaterial3: true,
    scaffoldBackgroundColor: const Color(0xFFFFFFFF),
  );
  return base.copyWith(
    textTheme: GoogleFonts.dmSansTextTheme(base.textTheme),
  );
}
```

When applying text styles directly in widgets:
```dart
// Correct — direct usage
Text(
  'Hello',
  style: GoogleFonts.dmSans(
    fontSize: 16,
    fontWeight: FontWeight.w500,
    color: AppColors.textPrimary,
  ),
)

// Correct — via theme (textTheme is already DM Sans)
Text('Hello', style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.bodyLarge)

// WRONG — never do this
Text('Hello', style: TextStyle(fontFamily: 'Roboto'))
Text('Hello', style: TextStyle(fontFamily: 'SF Pro'))
```

Font weight conventions:
- Regular body text: `FontWeight.w400`
- Medium / labels / buttons / subtitles: `FontWeight.w500`
- Headings / emphasis: `FontWeight.w600`
- Never use `w700` or `w800` — too heavy for this design system

Type scale:
- Screen title: 17–18sp w600
- Section heading: 15–16sp w600
- Body: 13–14sp w400
- Label / caption: 11–12sp w500
- Micro / tags: 10sp w500

