## NAMING CONVENTIONS

| Thing | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Files | snake_case | `order_repository.dart` |
| Classes | PascalCase | `OrderRepository` |
| Variables/methods | camelCase | `fetchOrders()` |
| Constants | camelCase | `firestoreCollections` |
| Riverpod providers | camelCase + Provider suffix | `activeOrdersProvider` |
| Riverpod notifiers | PascalCase + Notifier suffix | `OrdersNotifier` |
| Use cases | PascalCase + UseCase suffix | `GetActiveOrdersUseCase` |
| Entities | PascalCase, no suffix | `Order`, `CarPreferences` |
| Data models | PascalCase + Model suffix | `OrderModel`, `CarPreferencesModel` |
| Failures | PascalCase + Failure suffix | `FirestoreFailure`, `AuthFailure` |
| Repositories (interface) | PascalCase + Repository | `OrderRepository` |
| Repositories (impl) | PascalCase + RepositoryImpl | `OrderRepositoryImpl` |
| Data sources | PascalCase + DataSource | `OrderFirestoreDataSource` |

