deadlineAt, status (pending/paid/expired/cancelled),
sentAt, paidAt, expiredAt, cancelledAt

NOTE: ALL payment requests are created manually by the agent.
invoiceImageUrl: optional invoice photo attachment
timelineStageKey: links request to order_timeline stage —
  when set, buyer sees 'Pay now →' on that timeline step

### documents
id, orderId, uploadedByUserId, uploadedByRole, docType (ghana_id/vehicle_title/
bill_of_lading/commercial_invoice/packing_list/payment_receipt/gra_declaration/
duty_receipt/insurance_certificate/repair_quote/repair_receipt/delivery_note/other),
label, fileUrl, fileType, fileSizeKb, vin, status (not_started/pending/verified/rejected),
rejectionReason, isAutoPopulated, notes, uploadedAt, verifiedAt

### order_timeline
id, orderId, stageNumber (1-8), stageKey, label, detail, actionLabel,
actionType (payment/chat/tracking/clearance/repair/none), actionTargetId,
isComplete, isActive, isBlocked, completedAt, activatedAt

8 stages (stageKey values):
  preferences_submitted, agent_assigned, deposit_paid,
  searching, vehicle_balance, shipping, clearance,
  repair (hidden if car_preferences.repairOptedIn == false), delivery

Timeline is fully dynamic — rendered from Firestore stream.
Never hardcode step structure in Flutter widgets.
Sub-action hierarchy per step:
  Tier 1: pending payment_request with matching timelineStageKey → "Pay now →"
  Tier 2: relevant stage document exists → show status view
  Tier 3: fallback → "Chat with agent →"

### delivery
id, orderId, deliveryAddress, deliveryCity, recipientName, recipientPhone,
scheduledDate, actualDeliveryDate, deliveredBy, proofOfDeliveryUrl,
buyerConfirmed, buyerConfirmedAt, notes, createdAt

### buyer_reviews
id, orderId, buyerId, agentId, overallRating, agentRating,
communicationRating, speedRating, comment, createdAt

### garages
id, name, location, city, phone, email, isVetted, rating, totalJobs,
specialisations, isActive, addedAt

### exchange_rates
id, usdToGhs, source, fetchedAt, validForDate, isCurrent

### cost_defaults
id, key, value, label, currency, updatedBy, updatedAt

### system_settings
id, key, value, label, updatedBy, updatedAt
# Key settings: depositPercentage, serviceFeeGhs, clearanceServiceFeeGhs,
# repairPlatformFeeGhs, maxAgentOrders, inactivityDormantHours

