## BUSINESS RULES — ALWAYS ENFORCE

1. `orders.firstPaymentMade = false` → buyer can edit car_preferences and cancel order
2. `orders.firstPaymentMade = true` → no edit/cancel without admin
3. All payment requests created by agents — buyers only pay, never initiate
4. Chat is per-order — no global inbox
5. Documents are per-order — accessed within order detail tabs
6. Notifications are global — aggregated across all orders
7. Initial payment = deposit (10% of purchase price) + service fee (from system_settings)
8. Deposit is deducted from balance payment — NOT an extra charge
9. Exchange rate fetched from Firestore `exchange_rates` where `isCurrent = true`
10. OTP login only — no email/password auth
11. Role must be 'buyer' — redirect to error if user has role 'agent'
12. Payment requests only show "Pay now" when status = 'pending'
13. Agent assigned notification: sent by Cloud Function, not client
14. Order edit creates a `preference_edit_history` document every time

---

## UI/UX RULES

### Colours
- Primary: `#378ADD`
- Success: `#1D9E75`
- Warning text: `#BA7517` / Warning background: `#FAEEDA`
- Danger: `#E24B4A`
- Info text: `#185FA5` / Info background: `#E6F1FB`
- Primary background: `#FFFFFF` (white)
- Secondary background: `#F5F4F0` (off-white)
- Tertiary background: `#F0EFE8` (subtle off-white)
- Border: `rgba(0,0,0,0.12)`
- Text primary: `#1A1A18`
- Text secondary: `#666666`
- Text tertiary: `#AAAAAA`

### Spacing & Layout
- Base unit: 4dp
- Standard padding: 14–16dp
- Card internal padding: 12–13dp
- Border radius: 8dp (md), 12dp (lg), 16dp (xl), 20dp (pill)
- Card elevation: subtle shadow only — `BoxShadow(blurRadius: 8, color: Colors.black.withOpacity(0.06))`

### Navigation structure
- Bottom navigation: **3 tabs only** — Home, Notifications, Profile
- Chat and Documents: **per-order tabs only** — NOT global
- Order detail tabs: Overview | Chat (with unread badge) | Documents

### Component rules
- Payment CTA banner: always at top of order overview when payment_request is pending
- Unread badge on Chat tab: count of unread messages from agent
- Loading states: shimmer placeholders — never blank screens or spinners alone
- Error states: illustrated error card + retry button — never silent failures
- Empty states: icon/illustration + helpful instructional message
- All status badges: coloured pill with text — see colour system above
- All action buttons: minimum 48dp height, full width on mobile
- All tappable cards: `InkWell` with `borderRadius` matching card radius

### Interaction polish (investor demo grade)
- Page transitions: smooth slide or fade — never abrupt cuts
- List items: subtle fade-in on first load
- Payment CTA: pulse animation on the pay button when deadline is within 24h
- Bid won screen: confetti or particle animation on entry
- Success states: scale-in checkmark animation
- Form validation: inline real-time feedback — never wait until submit

